X-WR-CALNAME:Weaver line disruption
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-11T03:30:00&endDate=2026-10-11T09:15:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWEAVER LINE: Sunday 11 October\, until 1015\, no service between Liverpool Street and Cheshunt / Chingford / Enfield Town. The limited number of GREATER ANGLIA and STANSTED EXPRESS trains which usually stop at Seven Sisters will stop at Tottenham Hale instead\, and these trains will not serve Hackney Downs. Use London Underground connections between Central London and Seven Sisters / Hackney Downs.
DTEND:20261011T091500Z
DTSTART:20261011T033000Z
SUMMARY:Weaver line: Planned Closure
UID:2a59afcf-29a0-4702-af1b-fd2c4072959c@2a59.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/status/?Input=&lineIds=&dateTypeSelect=Future%20date&direction=&startDate=2026-10-17T03:30:00&endDate=2026-10-19T00:29:00">Disruption map.</a>\n\nWEAVER LINE: Saturday 17 and Sunday 18 October\, no service between Edmonton Green and Cheshunt. Replacement bus service L2 operates between Enfield Town and Cheshunt via Southbury\, Turkey Street (Hertford Road)\, Waltham Cross (for Greater Anglia) and Theobalds Grove.
DTEND:20261019T002900Z
DTSTART:20261017T033000Z
SUMMARY:Weaver line: Part Closure
